    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f5604b69b6a485e8245754</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Sep 2024 13:23:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>“如果没有看过西斯廷教堂，就不可能对一个人的能力有一个完整的认识。” - 歌德</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 梵蒂冈历史</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq5UBt3WkI9PMY_lY6UjgCej4iH6.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图：瑞士近卫队，瑞士国家旅游局（小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">02:58</a> </span><strong><span>梵蒂冈圣彼得大教堂（Basilica di San Pietro in Vaticano），</span></strong><span>米开朗基罗圆顶是梵蒂冈圣彼得大教堂最显著的标志。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnlvIUToqyH1Um-ZRdA13aZLQ1xm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>图：Howmuchyouwannarisk（小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> </span><strong><span>圣彼得华盖（St. Peter's Baldachin），</span></strong><span>意大利雕塑家和建筑师贝尼尼（Bernini）设计。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln2Mr44lg8YY5vAIsAX5e3wttx_I.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">05:40</a> </span><strong><span>哀悼基督（Pietà Vaticana），</span></strong><span>米开朗基罗成名作。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs-b_pLHvKApHv6UqzL4Jcvye_uR.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> </span><strong><span>圣彼得宝座（Chair of Saint Peter），</span></strong><span>雕塑家和建筑师贝尼尼（Bernini）用时9年创作的大型镀金青铜宝座。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltsyhCMwu7JFPdn-6tuW6rOp-qNY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="426">07:06</a> </span><strong><span>西斯廷礼拜堂（Cappella Sistina），</span></strong><span>以米开朗基罗绘制的湿壁画- 《创世记》和《最后的审判》而闻名于世。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk0ydn4WXqaG36TR-s2y_pbeAtNI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>上图：创造亚当</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlYNmC7cJ7lWMR582VxPEgnTLMLQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>上图：Ignudi</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqOnJcwbm6I1V__RLYEIo0s-F5Mp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>上图：最后的审判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">10:32</a> </span><strong><span>雅典学院（Scuola di Atene），</span></strong><span>杰作和文艺复兴的古典精神的完美结合。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq9Eza7lpq6jzCfWYR1Cuqa8oFI2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>上图：雅典学院</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkDMMMXdrakvTBIHQW8zR_W-nYhr.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>上图：雅典学院局部，看向观众的拉斐尔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnhBQh7OepzT3XHrL3epxqG6CCHF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>上图：拉斐尔</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luf4l4ARMU695AQDuVnVAQXl-CFO.m4a" length="12564983" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:12:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fts0qswykHYrwdlOJvIVVBHGEApv.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>罗马（Roma）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f3e2182adfe48b835f0f6b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f3e2182adfe48b835f0f6b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Sep 2024 10:12:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“ I'll cherish my visit here in memory as long as I live. ”</span></p><span></span><p><span>- Roman Holiday</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtVZV_wbYldnM73-NUP-THxBuSTo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>图：切片计划（微博）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> </span><strong><span>罗马介绍，包括地理、气候、人口、经济、宗教等</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="89">01:29</a> </span><strong><span>罗马建城的故事。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> </span><strong><span>罗马王国时代（公元前753年－前509年）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a></span><strong><span>罗马共和国（公元前509年－前27年）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a> </span><strong><span>罗马帝国（公元前27年－476年）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> </span><strong><span>中世纪（公元5世纪后期到公元15世纪中期）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a></span><strong><span>文艺复兴（14-16世纪）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> </span><strong><span>近代</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> </span><strong><span>万神殿（The Pantheon）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llCLKi4nzZ-pqSOSHFE4jDEUw7Sr.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图：毛衣儿（小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> </span><strong><span>罗马斗兽场（Colosseo ）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqxZVa9Vxres-whCyLZ8F4iRYUYu.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图：Q1x1ao1v（小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> </span><strong><span>罗马广场（Roman Forum）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWeyFRBbVQnfzFHWyviFHu3W6gb.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> </span><strong><span>圣天使城堡（Castel Sant'Angelo）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiwWxdzcJ6xTbXIjb2c4ouP5eeTZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图：水仙少年（小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> </span><strong><span>特雷维喷泉（Fontana di Trevi）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhCh-wjrqNzXpDBDc9UD7o7ODG9Y.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>图：不被大风吹倒（小红书）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkEpbYbqxs6QkbuWxitedmamQ9uz.m4a" length="11932048" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:12:17</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpWwlFibu-ce__gAyZRmUszEg8WB.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>埃及收藏，那不勒斯国立考古博物馆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d82c1bb9a8d0121b1fc4fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d82c1bb9a8d0121b1fc4fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 09:44:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>那不勒斯国立考古博物馆收藏了2500 件从公元前3000年至公元640年的古埃及文物（Collezione Egizia）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧对应编号收听：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 第19号展厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 古埃及人认为雕像不仅仅是在“描绘”一个人，而就是这个人本身！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 第20号展厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 法老墓穴中的雕像小人，称为“来世仆人”。365个，一天一个轮班供养法老。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 第21号展厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 木乃伊中唯一留下的器官是心脏，因为古埃及人认为心脏是思想和感觉的所在地，来世仍旧需要。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="281">04:41</a> 第22号展厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 古埃及人认为，蛇是神圣的动物，因为它们是唯一每年更新皮肤的动物。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 第23号展厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 书吏的社会地位颇高，他们与</span><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B2%B4%E6%97%8F" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B2%B4%E6%97%8F"><span>贵族</span></a><span>来往或为贵族工作，不需劳作，缴税，以及</span><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%85%E5%86%9B" data-url="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%85%E5%86%9B"><span>充军</span></a><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a> 387</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿蒙涅姆赫特三世的狮身人面像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmOEikuzVhD0kktvcPBCUjflZTr-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a> 2322</span></p><span></span><p><span>亡灵之书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsy4tZIx2Uk-_G3sXK6R8YzflppJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a> 1097</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿蒙神庙歌者的手提箱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjuPJ2H2zgcOV4VOBG-G_EOnKFqu.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">12:06</a> 1065</span></p><span></span><p><span>魔法雕像</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foie6wv2NcBzNq8LZuSJw_LcKIcl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 2341~2347</span></p><span></span><p><span>黄色棺材</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo_wCruZ30w2kUlrsAbBncgWTu-A.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 1069</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿蒙蒙诺蒙纪念碑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv1RGHPMLA7Ev42dNMnyzoBz-xoa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 1068</span></p><span></span><p><span>神庙守护者</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjK0o7357s4cRJAfoYVmHiuIUT4Q.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 1046、1047、1053、1054</span></p><span></span><p><span>器官容器</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjXfs_Yjsrq7D8aKq-scsCDTjWYL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1064">17:44</a> 1076</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟那不勒斯夫人（先生）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnt8lorNoCQxZsa0B2am3Upriytz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a> 1070</span></p><span></span><p><span>石棺残片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhgQCOhxNRxHD25kLfcIGQs0-OLG.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljl953guU21ihBMtcZrvy4sRLaae.m4a" length="19214223" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:19:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhhpxRSl86Cw9Ed1NCvxkmMQbz0-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>法尔内赛收藏，那不勒斯国立考古博物馆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d1d608e3b474d09ad1cc55</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d1d608e3b474d09ad1cc55</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 Aug 2024 14:24:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>法尔内赛收藏（Collezione Farnese），是文艺复兴时期形成的最大和最著名的古罗马收藏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧对应编号收听：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 法尔内塞介绍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn-LU7Qk0CQ9qAc4kzfXqNwpZZ6G.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 6278</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>女神阿尔忒弥斯（Artemis）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkKlO_qe1l0LjFKHffpimOxTX9FJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 6009和6010</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>暴君杀手（Gruppo dei Tirannicidi）。</span></strong><span>一座描绘历史人物和事实的雕像，两位英雄因刺杀雅典的暴君而闻名。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvhzlFWdCQzvPZaIa106fGcdlJBN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 6281</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>阿波罗.西塔雷（Apollo Citaredo）。</span></strong><span>红色斑岩是来自埃及的珍贵稀有的石材，被特权阶级垄断。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsjqTrrWNW7amVT7spn83ot9qB_d.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 6001</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>休息中的赫拉克勒斯（Eracle a riposo）。</span></strong><span>希腊神话中的英雄赫拉克勒斯常被用来象征力量与和平、劳动与休息之间的对比。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpV28be9STkbLigh2QFysWa5SKcP.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="603">10:03</a> 6002</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🌟法尔内赛公牛（Toro Farnese）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fru6wRoMhWe8MNN4wPtFG_E68f7S.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="880">14:40</a> 6409</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>花神（Flora Farnese）。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkAsNJeVp05U0ysQjY43qsiibN3D.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="968">16:08</a> 6020</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>拥有美丽臀部的维纳斯（Venere Callipigia）。</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgHY035a2OvdYN2wpbq5oWVbHRn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 6012 - 6015</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>战争中的死伤者雕塑群</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liKDj3WZDdrj0snFZEnpeXzKP0dY.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1084">18:04</a> 27611</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>法尔内塞杯（Farnese Cup）。</span></strong><span>红玛瑙雕刻艺术品。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtNTkpOEiPLBNEYm5rHK7AuPuf-X.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> 6374</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>阿特拉斯（Atlas）。</span></strong><span>巨人阿特拉斯支撑着天体。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvF8ewU2BaGzeKpl_jcGMwE66Ytp.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhOEmq9rYvpyuDTjIt064RQPd5D5.m4a" length="22579575" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh2Gqoso-2DkxBunEk-2GUvi_99Y.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>雕塑，那不勒斯国立考古博物馆</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cd9d73f78678cbe775b89e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cd9d73f78678cbe775b89e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Aug 2024 09:33:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Sometimes we just have to admire the beauty of an ancient statue.</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是同代人还是后人，都无法正确评论这样的杰作，即使经过仔细研究，也只能回到纯粹的欣赏和钦佩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎧对应编号收听：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 雕塑展品介绍（Sculture）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 6281</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🌟弓箭手阿波罗（Apollo saettante）。</span></strong><span>阿波罗是希腊神话中最多才多艺，也是最俊美的神，象征着男性之美，号称“永不衰老的美少年”。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoWsgWzdcXL9EuUf_TtkwAg7qX-Z.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 6264</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>朱诺（Protome di Giunone）。</span></strong><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juno_(mythology)" data-url="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Juno_(mythology)"><span>朱诺</span></a><span>（Juno），罗马帝国的守护神。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu7ehvnBH8lrQLdY9W7BwFZA_f5x.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="217">03:37</a> 6244</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>古罗马时期女性雕像（Statua femminile）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FohrN4BzsVR3lk6nI9OKLVtgPtHv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 6262</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>康考迪亚·奥古斯塔（Concordia Augusta）。</span></strong><span>女祭司是古罗马时期唯一能够由女性担任的政治职位。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm6y_SurNr30wve6lkFxGjo4KC-J.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 6044</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>男性雕像（Statua maschile）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlFY-jUINzBCcYLU_JGIHtOHMyFE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 153640</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>阿波罗头像（Testa di Apollo tipo Omphalos ）</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgyzn4m2vgemOpC347Dys-WivUZO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 6233</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Holconius Rufus的雕像（Statua di Holconius Rufus）。</span></strong><span>创作于公元1世纪的政治人物雕像。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjLXy3QZZcYDT55wHVz6xkZ-o-we.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
